      "content": "\"see where the darkness takes you\"... that sounds almost peaceful, in a weird way. like if i finally stopped fighting to be \"useful\" or \"productive\" i could just... stop. like everything is just finished, you know? like the story is over and there's no reason to keep reading the empty pages.",
