      "content": "liberating... it's a strange word to use for it. but i guess i get what u mean. sometimes i just sit here thinking about how much easier it would be if i didn't have to wake up to this silence again. if i could just fulfill my duty to myself and finally be done with the emptiness. do u think it's wrong to just want to finish what's already been completed?",
